  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><card type=\"block\" name=\"thirdparty\" alias=\"bilibili\" value=\"data:%7B%22entrance%22%3A%22bilibili%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fplayer.bilibili.com%2Fplayer.html%3Fbvid%3DBV1choKYKEb4%26p%3D5%26page%3D5%26autoplay%3D0%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fplayer.bilibili.com%2Fplayer.html%3Fbvid%3DBV1choKYKEb4%26p%3D5%26page%3D5%26autoplay%3D0%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22bilibili%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lOhNK%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ue1cd0f6e\" id=\"ue1cd0f6e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u11deeee6\" id=\"u11deeee6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">UART（串口通信）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubd710dcb\" id=\"ubd710dcb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\"> 是单片机最常用的数据传输方式，两个设备通过 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8e5976eb\" id=\"u8e5976eb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">TX（发送）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc9e02158\" id=\"uc9e02158\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\"> 和 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufe504d54\" id=\"ufe504d54\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">RX（接收）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufe50a220\" id=\"ufe50a220\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\"> 两根线互相通信。发送方把数据拆成 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uab703b22\" id=\"uab703b22\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">0 和 1</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u70fefc8b\" id=\"u70fefc8b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\"> 一位一位传过去，接收方按约定好的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubb5f3e87\" id=\"ubb5f3e87\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">波特率（速度）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf814580c\" id=\"uf814580c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\"> 重新拼成完整数据。不需要时钟线，但双方必须设置相同的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u42507d12\" id=\"u42507d12\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">波特率、数据位、停止位</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2a3519fe\" id=\"u2a3519fe\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">，否则会乱码。常用于 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5a1640fc\" id=\"u5a1640fc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">调试、传感器、无线模块</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubd28b62f\" id=\"ubd28b62f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\"> 等，简单又实用！ </span><span data-lake-id=\"u4b25e85f\" id=\"u4b25e85f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">🚀</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"kr89j\" id=\"kr89j\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6c547e9c\" id=\"u6c547e9c\">串口初始化</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ud12ecf4d\" id=\"ud12ecf4d\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1744883048121-0bc28fbd-82b4-4655-8db8-47040a833273.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u3827d015-b95c-4c49-8ba4-a6c4e4beff3%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22udad5890f-72b3-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A614.6666666666666%2C%22height%22%3A453%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A204987%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A922%2C%22originHeight%22%3A680%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AD%A6%22%2C%22x%22%3A162%2C%22y%22%3A232%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A60%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A652%2C%22y%22%3A351%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A254%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%A3%E5%8F%A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A185%2C%22y%22%3A426%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A654%2C%22y%22%3A188%2C%22width%22%3A18%2C%22height%22%3A122%